# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules — STAGED FOR PROMOTION, not yet live.
#
# This file is dormant during the /newsitedemo/ review phase: the build only
# ships the active `_redirects` to the publish root, so nothing here affects the
# live site while the old /app/ URLs still serve real pages.
#
# At promotion (when the reorganized site moves from /newsitedemo/ to the root),
# rename this file to `_redirects`. It is the COMPLETE post-promotion ruleset:
# the legacy portfolio->clouds rules plus the new /app/* -> clean-URL rules.
#
# Cloudflare Pages preserves query strings automatically, so
# /app/abnormie?id=1234 lands at /abnormie?id=1234.

# Legacy: /app/portfolio* was renamed to /app/clouds* before the reorg.
/app/portfolio.html  /app/clouds.html  301
/app/portfolio       /app/clouds       301

# Reorg: old /app/ URLs map to the new clean URLs.
/app/mint            /         301
/app/mint/           /         301
/app/clouds          /home     301
/app/clouds/         /home     301
/app/abnormie        /abnormie  301
